==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|fótur||[[foot]]}} + {{m|is|gangandi||[[walking]]}}, from {{m|is|ganga||to [[walk]]}}. Literally meaning "walking by foot"

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverb}}

# [[by foot]], [[on foot]], [[by walking]]
#: ''Að fara '''fótgangandi'''.''
#:: To go '''by foot'''.